{
  "about": "The daily Sefer Shemirat HaLashon luach: one cycle a year by Hebrew month and day, one table for a common year and one for a leap year. Transcribed from shemiratHaLashonBase.js of @hebcal/learning 6.13.1 (https://github.com/hebcal/hebcal-learning), read as text. An entry names a part (introduction by paragraph; remembering, discerning, torah and epilogue1 of book one, chapters and epilogue2 of book two, by chapter.paragraph) and a range; `c.p*` is the author's gloss on that paragraph, read on a day of its own, which no range reads. Read by scripts/halacha/build.js; never edited by hand without a correction entry.",
